# gitkit's own test fixtures and docs deliberately contain fake secrets — they
# are the corpus the scanner is tested against. Keep every pattern here narrow
# enough that a real leak in this repo would still be caught.

# AWS's own documented example key ID. Used in tests, README and /guard.
AKIAIOSFODNN7EXAMPLE

# Private-key header inside a quoted test-fixture string (test_scan_staged.py).
PRIVATE KEY-----"

# The fake password in the generic-secret test.
hunter2-correct-horse
